# M-ALL08 -- W2-CA-09 team release/recruit. ALL08u: the paradrop start team
# finishes and 'Each to His Own House' recruits Tanya/GIs/engineers into the
# TanyaLand/GILand/EngineerLand teams -> no '_Loss (Tanya KIA)' (the run
# must survive past f=900 with no input), then the Soviet houses removed
# (combat skip) -> '_Win Occurred' -> WON.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL08u.MAP GDI

until 60 scene == campaign-load
require scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
assert mode == campaign
wait 1200
assert outcome == RUNNING
assert units(5) > 0
assert units(6) > 0
wait 600
cheat kill_house 1
cheat kill_house 2
until 1500 outcome == WON
assert outcome == WON
